<!--
  The themed-icon layer: one flat silhouette, no second cloud and no colour of
  its own. The launcher replaces the fill with a wallpaper-derived tint when the
  user turns on "Themed icons", so any colour here is discarded — what matters
  is that the shape reads at a glance as a single mass.

  Same geometry as the foreground's front cloud, so the outline does not shift
  when themed icons are switched on.
-->
